{"url": "https://x.com/ChrisAdcockMD/status/2101108292617408740", "id": "2101108292617408740", "text": "Took Gregor\u2019s Ultrafast repo and wired it into Grok Bot template. @bot\n\nYour bots can now use Jev to drive the real Chrome on the machine instead of slow look-and-click. Drop in the API key you already have (OpenRouter or TypeSafe), and it gets going.\n\nIt also walks your existing bot workflows and flags which decisions Jev can take over \u2014 the quick yes/no and \u201cpick one of these options\u201d calls \u2014 so you\u2019re not guessing where it helps.\n\nlink if you want to try it: https://x.ai/bot/sM_Xi4OF09cGU8KGyLvlC", "raw_text": {"text": "Took Gregor\u2019s Ultrafast repo and wired it into Grok Bot template. @bot\n\nYour bots can now use Jev to drive the real Chrome on the machine instead of slow look-and-click. Drop in the API key you already have (OpenRouter or TypeSafe), and it gets going.\n\nIt also walks your existing bot workflows and flags which decisions Jev can take over \u2014 the quick yes/no and \u201cpick one of these options\u201d calls \u2014 so you\u2019re not guessing where it helps.\n\nlink if you want to try it: https://t.co/009CZNss8u", "display_text_range": [0, 489], "facets": [{"type": "mention", "indices": [66, 70], "original": "bot", "id": "2085838061347217408"}, {"type": "media", "indices": [281, 304], "id": "2101108283214061568", "display": "pic.x.com/a9v0lepRrM", "original": "https://t.co/a9v0lepRrM", "replacement": "https://x.com/ChrisAdcockMD/status/2101108292617408740/video/1"}, {"type": "url", "indices": [466, 489], "original": "https://t.co/009CZNss8u", "replacement": "https://x.ai/bot/sM_Xi4OF09cGU8KGyLvlC", "display": "x.ai/bot/sM_Xi4OF09\u2026"}]}, "author": {"screen_name": "ChrisAdcockMD", "url": "https://x.com/ChrisAdcockMD", "id": "225713525", "followers": 1853, "following": 1091, "likes": 9127, "media_count": 996, "name": "Chris Adcock MD \ud83c\udf4a\ud83d\udc8a", "description": "doc by day, BTC by night 